   "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Box_office_collection\">Box office collection</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=List_of_Hindi_films_of_2025&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Box office collection\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=List_of_Hindi_films_of_2025&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Box office collection\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The following is the <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_highest-grossing_Hindi_films\" title=\"List of highest-grossing Hindi films\">list of highest-grossing Hindi cinema films</a> released in 2025.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><b>#</b>\n</td>\n<td>Implies that the film is multilingual and the gross collection figure includes the worldwide collection of the other simultaneously filmed version.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<caption>Highest grossing Hindi cinema films of 2025\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Rank<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ro&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ro-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>a<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</th>\n<th>Title\n</th>\n<th>Production company\n</th>\n<th>Distributor\n</th>\n<th>Worldwide gross\n</th>\n<th class=\"unsortable\"><abbr title=\"Reference(s)\">Ref.</abbr>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">1\n</th>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Dhurandhar\" title=\"Dhurandhar\">Dhurandhar</a></i>\n</td>\n<td><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1126788409\">.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-pa