(film)\" title=\"Saiyaara (film)\">Saiyaara</a></i>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Yash_Raj_Films\" title=\"Yash Raj Films\">Yash Raj Films</a>\n</td>\n<td>Yash Raj Films\n</td>\n<td>₹579.23 crore\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-boxoffww&#95;3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-boxoffww-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">4\n</th>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/War_2_(film)\" title=\"War 2 (film)\">War 2</a></i>\n</td>\n<td>Yash Raj Films\n</td>\n<td>Yash Raj Films\n</td>\n<td>₹303–351 crore\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-boxoffww&#95;3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-boxoffww-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">5\n</th>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Mahavatar_Narsimha\" title=\"Mahavatar Narsimha\">Mahavatar Narsimha</a></i><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-mn&#95;8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-mn-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>α<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\"><ul><li>Kleem Productions</li></ul></div>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/AA_Films\" title=\"AA Films\">AA Films</a>\n</td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">₹300.82 crore</span> <b>#</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-mahavatar&#95;14-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-mahavatar-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>b<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">6\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Sitaare_Zameen_Par\" title=\"Sitaare Zameen Par\">Sitaare Zameen Par</a></i>\n</td>\n<td>Aamir Khan Productions\n</td>\n<td><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/PVR_Inox_Pictures\" title=\"PVR Inox Pictures\">PVR Inox Pictures</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/AA_Films\" title=\"AA Films\">AA Films</a></li></ul></div>\n</td>\n<td>₹266.49 crore\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-15\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-boxoffww&#95;3-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-boxoffww-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">7\n</th>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Raid_2_(film)\" title=\"Raid 2 (film)\">Raid 2</a></i>\n</td>\n<td><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/T-Series_(company)\" title=\"T-Series (company)\">T-Series Films</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Panorama_Studios\" title=\"Panorama Studios\">Panorama Studios</a></li></ul></div>\n</td>\n<td><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/PVR_Inox_Pictures\" title=\"PVR Inox Pictures\">PVR Inox Pictures</a></li><li>Panorama Studios</li></ul></div>\n</td>\n<td>₹243.06 crore\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:ce