td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-19\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-19\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>16<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-boxoffww&#95;3-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-boxoffww-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">10\n</th>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Thamma\" title=\"Thamma\">Thamma</a></i>\n</td>\n<td>Maddock Films\n</td>\n<td><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/PVR_Inox_Pictures\" title=\"PVR Inox Pictures\">PVR Inox Pictures</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Yash_Raj_Films\" title=\"Yash Raj Films\">Yash Raj Films</a></li></ul></div>\n</td>\n<td>₹169.75 crore\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-20\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-20\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>17<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-boxoffww&#95;3-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-boxoffww-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br /><span class=\"error mw-ext-cite-error\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Cite error: There are <code>&lt;ref&#160;group&#61;lower-alpha&gt;</code> tags&#160;or <code>&#123;&#123;efn&#125;&#125;</code> templates on this page, but the references will not show without a <code>&#123;&#123;reflist&#124;group&#61;lower-alpha&#125;&#125;</code> template&#160;or <code>&#123;&#123;notelist&#125;&#125;</code> template (see the <a href=\"/wiki/Help:Cite_errors/Cite_error_group_refs_without_references\" title=\"Help:Cite errors/Cite error group refs without references\">help page</a>).</span></p><div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<l